  "content": "<p data-pid=\"wNedwit7\">之前在这里答过了：</p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2068986826120073492/answer/2069817815805194924\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"有那些扭曲百合作品？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-92c11c2f07e2ffd0c4bb295a215e61e9.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">有那些扭曲百合作品？</a><p data-pid=\"lh4A-u1g\">再补充几部吧：</p><h2>《只对我冷淡的妹妹，最近突然对我撒娇》</h2><p data-pid=\"mhsP741v\">主要的扭点在于……自己读吧：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"QLyLRymv\">「姐姐……欺负人」<br/>这句稚气十足的话，几乎让我的脑袋裂成两半。一半的我，还想继续。另一半的我，却渐渐恢復了理智。</blockquote><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-42776ec2c22020f1739a44eeadf11603_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1488\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-original-token=\"v2-42776ec2c22020f1739a44eeadf11603\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1488\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-42776ec2c22020f1739a44eeadf11603_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1488&#39; height=&#39;2048&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1488\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-original-token=\"v2-42776ec2c22020f1739a44eeadf11603\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1488\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-42776ec2c22020f1739a44eeadf11603_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-42776ec2c22020f1739a44eeadf11603_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>《姐姐的挚友、我的恋人。》</h2><p data-pid=\"q0xYVRdb\">主要的扭点在于：姐姐、姐姐的“前女友”</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-764a6ee24e36beb99123d1a547c83667_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"903\" data-rawheight=\"1279\" data-original-token=\"v2-764a6ee24e36beb99123d1a547c83667\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"903\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-764a6ee24e36beb99123d1a547c83667_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;903&#39; height=&#39;1279&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"903\" data-rawheight=\"1279\" data-original-token=\"v2-764a6ee24e36beb99123d1a547c83667\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"903\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-764a6ee24e36beb99123d1a547c83667_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-764a6ee24e36beb99123d1a547c83667_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>《败给了性格恶劣的天才青梅，初体验全部被夺走的那些事》</h2><p data-pid=\"ynfL8l9m\">主要的扭点在于：既然做不到相互喜欢，那就相互讨厌吧，连被讨厌都排不到第一什么的，那种事情不要啊（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-aec3fe835a54ef8a1b86e4a0770c5a5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1200\" data-rawheight=\"600\" data-original-token=\"v2-aec3fe835a54ef8a1b86e4a0770c5a5c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1200\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-aec3fe835a54ef8a1b86e4a0770c5a5c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1200&#39; height=&#39;600&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1200\" data-rawheight=\"600\" data-original-token=\"v2-aec3fe835a54ef8a1b86e4a0770c5a5c\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1200\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-aec3fe835a54ef8a1b86e4a0770c5a5c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-aec3fe835a54ef8a1b86e4a0770c5a5c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>《异类的天堂》</h2><p data-pid=\"sR94JdH3\">有点阴湿了（</p><p data-pid=\"7YKno-oc\">而且停止连载很久了，慎入</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4be168311b0d87503aa3a7cd27166a0d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1776\" data-rawheight=\"1260\" data-original-token=\"v2-4be168311b0d87503aa3a7cd27166a0d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1776\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4be168311b0d87503aa3a7cd27166a0d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1776&#39; height=&#39;1260&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1776\" data-rawheight=\"1260\" data-original-token=\"v2-4be168311b0d87503aa3a7cd27166a0d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1776\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-4be168311b0d87503aa3a7cd27166a0d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4be168311b0d87503aa3a7cd27166a0d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>《不可逆性加虐》</h2><p data-pid=\"EFkF9Eas\">？在这里推荐这部真的好吗？</p><p data-pid=\"qpYaGMz9\">看得都会幻痛的说（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c5ed3e31d81086c1b5b3dfb6abee5af6_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"600\" data-original-token=\"v2-c5ed3e31d81086c1b5b3dfb6abee5af6\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"400\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;400&#39; height=&#39;600&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"400\" data-rawheight=\"600\" data-original-token=\"v2-c5ed3e31d81086c1b5b3dfb6abee5af6\" class=\"content_image lazy\" width=\"400\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c5ed3e31d81086c1b5b3dfb6abee5af6_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p></p>",
